"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -48)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"96\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Does it block completing a primary task for any user group \u2014 keyboard, screen-reader, low-vision, motor?</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-flowchart-P0-3\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(138, 687)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-87\" width=\"260\" height=\"174\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -72)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"144\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>P0 \u2014 launch blocker. Fix before ship. e.g. keyboard trap, unlabeled primary form control, focus lost into the void, primary CTA fails contrast</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-flowchart-Q2-5\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(469, 687)\"><polygon points=\"151,0 302,-151 151,-302 0,-151\" class=\"label-container\" transform=\"translate(-150.5, 151)\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -36)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"72\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Is it a WCAG 2.2 AA failure on a page in a primary user flow?</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-flowchart-P1-7\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(303.5, 1111)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-99\" width=\"260\" height=\"198\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -84)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"168\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>P1 \u2014 fix-now / fast-follow. AA is the launch floor \u00a73 #1. e.g. missing focus indicator, heading skip in main content, low contrast on body text, img without alt in content</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-flowchart-Q3-9\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(634.5, 1111)\"><polygon points=\"151,0 302,-151 151,-302 0,-151\" class=\"label-container\" transform=\"translate(-150.5, 151)\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -36)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"72\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Is it an AA failure at all, or an AAA / best-practice nicety?</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-flowchart-P2-11\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(479.5, 1423)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-63\" width=\"260\" height=\"126\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -48)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"96\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>P2 \u2014 backlog with a date. Still an AA gap; schedule it, don't let it sit open &gt;30 days \u00a74</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-flowchart-P3-13\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(789.5, 1423)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-51\" width=\"260\" height=\"102\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -36)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"72\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>P3 \u2014 enhancement. Track, fix opportunistically; never block an AA fix behind it</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g><defs><filter id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-drop-shadow\" height=\"130%\" width=\"130%\"><feDropShadow dx=\"4\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"0\" flood-opacity=\"0.06\" flood-color=\"#000000\"/></filter></defs><defs><filter id=\"t-web-design--accessibility-remediation-how-to-prioritize-a-finding-drop-shadow-small\" height=\"150%\" width=\"150%\"><feDropShadow dx=\"2\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"0\" flood-opacity=\"0.06\" flood-color=\"#000000\"/></filter></defs></svg>",
